  "scenario_8_partial_null_case": {
    "description": "Gemini returns partial nulls; contact, qualification, location null. Microservices in skillsRaw originates from extractSkillsFromFallbackSections scanning raw resume text when detectSkillSection returns sectionDetected=false.",
    "explanation_microservices_origin": "In applyEvidenceLock (metaforgeParser.ts lines 180-210), rawText ('Jane Smith\\nSkills: Go\\nExperience in Go microservices.') is passed to extractSkillsWithEngineSync. Because 'Skills: Go' lacks a standard section heading, detectSkillSection returns sectionDetected=false. The engine then falls back to extractSkillsFromFallbackSections over the resume text. Scanning 'Experience in Go microservices.' matches 'microservices' in CORE_TECH_KEYWORDS, which is normalized and title-cased to 'Microservices'. The engine returns skills ['Go', 'Microservices'], which is locked into skillsRaw.",
    "requests": [
      {
        "request_index": 0,
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-flash-lite:generateContent",
